WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.913
You didn't start your business

2
00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:07.650
to chase paperwork at night.

3
00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.110
Quorra Dispatch lets you quote, schedule

4
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:12.045
send the crew, and get paid.

5
00:00:12.065 --> 00:00:13.550
All from one app.

6
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.428
When someone fills out

7
00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:16.880
the form on your website

8
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.210
it lands right on your leads board.

9
00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.530
You'll see who needs a call back

10
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.861
and what each job is worth.

11
00:00:23.531 --> 00:00:25.641
Build a quote from your price book.

12
00:00:25.661 --> 00:00:28.700
Then send it by link, text, or PDF.

13
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.160
Your customer can approve it

14
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.196
and pick a time on their own.

15
00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.286
Booked jobs fill your calendar

16
00:00:34.306 --> 00:00:36.381
with every tech assigned.

17
00:00:36.401 --> 00:00:38.636
So the whole crew knows where to be.

18
00:00:39.306 --> 00:00:41.726
On the road, your tech taps On my way

19
00:00:41.746 --> 00:00:43.143
to text the customer.

20
00:00:43.163 --> 00:00:44.323
Then checks in on arrival

21
00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.259
and starts the job.

22
00:00:46.929 --> 00:00:48.069
When the work is done

23
00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:49.835
take a card on the spot.

24
00:00:49.855 --> 00:00:52.255
Show a QR code for the customer to scan

25
00:00:52.275 --> 00:00:54.184
or text them the link.

26
00:00:54.204 --> 00:00:56.375
And the invoice is marked paid.

27
00:00:57.045 --> 00:00:59.585
You also get recurring service plans

28
00:00:59.605 --> 00:01:01.980
timesheets, and a customer portal.

29
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.300
Where clients can review quotes

30
00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.162
and pay invoices.

31
00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:08.290
Plans start at $80 a month.

32
00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:09.870
And monthly plans get half off

33
00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:11.772
for the first three months.

34
00:01:11.792 --> 00:01:14.446
Start your 14-day free trial today.
